category: Libs
requires: libabseil-devel libicu-devel libre2_11 pkg-config
sdesc: "Efficient, principled regular expression library (development)"
ldesc: "RE2 is a fast, safe, thread-friendly alternative to backtracking regular
expression engines like those used in PCRE, Perl, and Python. It is a C++
library."
external-source: re2

